'''Cosmic Lounge''' is the 24th stage in [[Cats of the Cosmos]]. In [[The Battle Cats POP!]], additional [[Cat Capsule|Rare Cat Capsule]] units are added. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], [[SUPERFEST (Gacha Event)|SUPERFEST]] is unlocked in the '''Japanese''' version whereas [[UBERFEST (Gacha Event)|UBERFEST]] is unlocked in the '''International''' version.

