==Trivia==
*Cosmic Lounge is the first [[Cats of the Cosmos]] stage to take place in a fictional location.
*Cosmic Lounge is a reference to ''Dragon Ball''<nowiki>'</nowiki>s planet [[wikia:dragonball:Namek|Namek]]. On the map it has the same antennae as the [[wikia:dragonball:Namekians|Namekians]], the slug on its enemy base is Namek's namesake (蛞蝓 ''namekuji'', slug), its [[Treasure]] is Antennae, and in [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]] its name is Planet Snack (惑星スナック Wakusei Sunakku), which is spelled and pronounced similarly to Planet Namek in Japanese (ナメック星 Sunakku-sei).
*The enemy base being a bag of chips makes more sense in the context of the stage's Japanese name, Planet Snack.
*In [[The Battle Cats POP!]], this stage is called '''Cosmic Club'''.
**Once beating this stage in The Battle Cats POP!, [[Crazed Cats (origin)|Crazed Cats]] will become obtainable from the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Cat Capsules|Rare Cat Capsules]].
*In The Battle Cats Unite!, its stage schematics is replaced with [[The Great Abyss (Into the Future)|The Great Abyss]]' chapter 3 schematics.

